---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Ishpreet — technical architect, writer, and builder.">
  <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-on-surface mb-12">
      About
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-[70ch]">
      <p>
        I'm Ishpreet — a technical architect and writer who digs deeper than most. I don't just use tools — I open the source, read the data, and figure out what's actually happening.
      </p>

      <p>
        This blog is where I publish the findings. Technical research, deep dives into developer tooling, and investigations into the systems we use every day. The goal is always the same: understand how things actually work, not how the marketing says they work.
      </p>

      <p>
        When something interesting comes out of the research, I build tools to solve the problems I find. You can see those on the <a href="/projects">projects page</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you want to follow along, the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> is the best way. No newsletter signup forms, no tracking pixels — just content.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
